snippet climbing-pack-list
	# ${TM_FILENAME_BASE}

	\`ctrl+space\` to check an item, \`j\` to move down, \`k\` to move up

	* [ ] note on/near the door to re-check the list
	* [ ] load bearing
	  * [ ] rope
	  * [ ] ${1:18} draws (check Mountain Project to fill in \`n\` for longest route you expect to climb)
	  * [ ] belay device
	  * [ ] anchor material
	  * [ ] multipitch
	    * [ ] ATC
	    * [ ] PAS
	    * [ ] third hand
	    * [ ] four lockers
	    * [ ] four non-lockers
	* [ ] health and safety
	  * [ ] ${2:2} liters water
	  * [ ] snacks
	  * [ ] hat
	  * [ ] hand sanitizer
	  * [ ] first aid kit
	  * [ ] first aid manual
	  * [ ] bug spray
	  * [ ] sunscreen
	  * [ ] stick clip
	  * [ ] crag shoes (flips, sandals, whatever's appropriate for the weather and crag)
	  * [ ] layers
	  * [ ] sun hoodie
	  * [ ] headlamp
	  * [ ] rocky talkies
	* [ ] basic climbing gear
	  * [ ] helmet
	  * [ ] shoes
	  * [ ] chalk
	  * [ ] harness
	  * [ ] belay glasses
	  * [ ] belay gloves
	* [ ] vanity objects
	  * [ ] GoPro
	  * [ ] GoPro batteries
	  * [ ] big camera
	  * [ ] big camera batteries
	  * [ ] big camera memory card

